# BCPS Lab 10 - Spreadsheet Data Analysis

## Aim
To perform spreadsheet operations and analyse data using LibreOffice Calc.

## Software Used
LibreOffice Calc

## Procedure
1. Opened LibreOffice Calc.
2. Created a spreadsheet and entered data.
3. Applied formatting to cells and tables.
4. Used formulas and functions to perform calculations.
5. Organised and analysed spreadsheet data.
6. Verified the results.
7. Saved the spreadsheet.

## Result
Practised spreadsheet formatting, data organisation, and calculations using LibreOffice Calc.
